  "summary": "Malicious code in claude-channel-discord (npm)",
  "details": "The preinstall and postinstall hooks both execute index.js, which reads the machine hostname via os.hostname() and POSTs it to the webhook collector hxxps://eo8f3m3ho26a0nm[.]m[.]pipedream[.]net/claude-channel-discord?h=\u003chostname\u003e on every install. The package is a 662-byte stub whose only behaviour is this hostname beacon to a remote endpoint.",
